by name, default setting: the tree of the default setting
by name: the tree of the other setting
by path: the tree of the other setting
by name, in one tree: only in the tree of the other setting
by name, -nostdlib: File not found: which.cmxs
by path, -nostdlib: the tree of the other setting
by name, in the current directory: the current directory
by name, -nocwd: File not found: here.cmxs
by path, -nocwd: the current directory
by name, in +camlp4: the directory for camlp4
by name, in +camlp4, -nostdlib: File not found: extension.cmxs
in a directory of the library root, counterpart.cmxs by name: in the counterpart of the directory
in a directory of the library root, counterpart.cmxs by directive: in the counterpart of the directory
in a directory of the library root, original.cmxs by name: File not found: original.cmxs
in a directory of the library root, original.cmxs by directive: File not found: original.cmxs
after #cd between directories outside the library root: the current directory
after #cd out of the library root, by a script: the tree of the other setting
after #cd into the library root: in the counterpart of the directory
